			"notes": "---\n## Version [1.6.0] - 2026-11-20\n\n### Features\n\n\n\n- enable U-key item-to-enchantment lookup, drop maxApplicableItems cap - ([89836c5](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/89836c53af455829110b62197776a77722c46657))\n- Apotheosis compat ([#26](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/issues/26)) - ([436e82f](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/436e82f97fadd86aa3bb77ff1e4e010de01f6129))\n- lookupEnchantmentsByItem config - ([054d162](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/054d162fb71ced76a8ab1d377062fb25ce4124f7))\n- add layout customization for enchantment info - ([b3b5a70](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/b3b5a70fd407b63210fabeba7de8c29b8de1066f))\n- accept .description as an enchantment description key ([#42](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/issues/42)) - ([a21d14c](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/a21d14c7ce3fc5b3c8805a538bb502e8c69dbc14))\n- add mod and enchantment blacklists to the config - ([b98eddb](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/b98eddb20b4ef6401f95cebecc7421fb0bdcb588))\n- add applicable item sorting and enchanting power line - ([38e8209](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/38e82096578ce2362546fb9b0c3189cb7e3ba2e2))\n- add hover tooltips for the info lines - ([0cab534](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/0cab534055f0ac0dd1680b5875dfb3151d3e259d))\n- open an item's enchantment pages with Shift+V - ([ae1867e](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/ae1867eb0ebd23a284bc7492f2af131c4c4c9b34))\n\n### Fixes\n\n\n\n- distinguish discoverable from the enchanting table flag - ([d6ace0e](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/d6ace0eaede07cbff3c3b7ff61f2435311b486bc))\n\n### Refactoring\n\n\n\n- migrate to stonecutter - ([29e7637](https://github.com/Suel-ki/UniversalEnchantmentInfo/commit/29e76370593bda988eb76c6a99589845cc39df5c))\n\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->"
